2.2 Users and Stakeholders (A2)

The primary users of the proposed UI/UX enhancement are UiTM students who use the uFuture platform to manage their academic activities. 
The proposed interface focuses on helping students check assignment deadlines, identify important tasks, and monitor their attendance 
more easily.The main stakeholders are UiTM students, lecturers, and uFuture administrators. 
Students are the direct users of the proposed interface, while lecturers and administrators are indirectly involved as 
they are part of the existing academic platform.
